								<YS>0</YS>
								<YO>60</YO>
							</UDim2>
							<token name="SizeConstraint">0</token>
							<string name="Text">BUILDING: This mode is used to produce buildings. A menu pops up next to the box and it lists a couple buildings. Select a building and the menu will tell you the cost of that building. Then click where you want to build it. IT MUST BE NEAR YOUR BUILDINGS.</string>
