							</UDim2>
							<token name="SizeConstraint">0</token>
							<string name="Text">RECRUITING: This mode is used to build units. Simply select the unit you want to build and click on a building, it will start building it.. NOTE: UNITS ARE ONLY BUILT AT CERTAIN BUILDINGS. For more on where they are built, please visit the &quot;Units&quot; page.</string>
